   "code": "SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER",
   "text": "While multiple seasons are available, the specific sequence of a teammate DRIVE immediately preceding a PNR might not occur frequently enough to achieve sufficient statistical power for robust conclusions, particularly if analyzing effects at a granular level (e.g., specific player combinations)."
  }
 ],
